                         LOGICAL ARRAY PAGE

   0     Page Code (2b)
   1     Page Length (42)
   2     LUN Status (00)
   3     RAID Level (05)
   4     LUN Type (00)
  5-8    LUN Blocksize (00 00 02 00)
  9-10   Drive Sector Size (02 00)
 11-14   LUN Number of Blocks (00 03 20 3f)
 15-18   Reserved (00 00 00 00)
 19-22   LUN Segment Size (00 00 00 01)
  23     LUN Segment0 Size (00)
 24-25   LUN Flags (00 00)
 26-29   Block Reconstructed (00 00 00 01)
  30     Reconstruction Frequency (00)
 31-32   Reconstruction Amount (00 00)
 33-35   Reserved (00 00 00)
